        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9100/31, Simple Solid Brass Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Simple Solid Brass Cabinet Knob is available in 6 finishes, all of which are beautifully crafted. It will be sure to add a classic look to any home. This cabinet knob has a 1-7/32 inch diameter and a 1-1/8 inch projection. The Simple Cabinet Knob comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/simple-vintage-finish-cabinet-knob-omnia-9100-31\"><b>Omnia 9100 Vintage Finish Simple Cabinet Knob</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/simple-stainless-steel-cabinet-knob-omnia-9100-us32d\"><b>Omnia 9100-US32D Simple Cabinet Knob in Brushed Stainless Steel</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Simple Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/locking-door-bars.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"514\" height=\"137\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
